    "description": "This market will resolve to \u201cYes\u201d if the U.S. Office of Personnel Management (OPM) announces another federal government shutdown due to a lapse in appropriations by January 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nPartial shutdowns count as shutdowns; announcements of office closures due to holidays or inclement weather do not qualify as a shutdown.\n\nThe resolution source for this market will be OPM\u2019s Operating Status page (https://www.opm.gov/policy-data-oversight/snow-dismissal-procedures/current-status/).",
