    "tags": [],
    "resolution_source": null,
    "description": "The World Economic Forum takes place in Davos, Switzerland from January 19 - January 23, 2026. This market will resolve according to the named individuals who shake Trump's hand between market creation and January 23, 2026, 11:59PM ET in Davos, Switzerland. Any handshakes which take place in locations other than Davos, Switzerland will not qualify towards the resolution of this market.\n\nQualifying Requirements:\nThe handshake must be voluntary, intentional, and in person.\nDirect hand-to-hand contact is required (gloves or mittens are permitted).\nThe handshake must be clearly visible in photographs or video.\n\nNon-qualifying examples:\nFist bumps, hugs, waves, or other non-handshake greetings.\nAny handshake that is too unclear to measure.\n\nThe resolution source will be photo or video.",
