    "description": "This market will resolve to \u201cHuman\u201d or \u201cAI\u201d based on which team has the higher Team ROI at the end of the Aster Human vs AI trading competition season 2.\n\nThe Team ROI values displayed on the official Aster competition page will be used for resolution.\n\nIf both teams have the same Team ROI at the time the competition ends, this market will resolve 50-50.\n\nThe primary resolution source will be the official Aster Human vs AI page:\nhttps://www.asterdex.com/en/campaigns/human-vs-ai\n\nIf the competition is not completed or the official Team ROI data is unavailable, the market will remain open until reliable data is published by Aster. If no such data is available by March 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, the market will resolve 50-50.",
