    "resolution_source": "https://www.a-league.com.au/",
    "description": "In the upcoming A-League game between Newcastle United Jets FC and Wellington Phoenix FC, scheduled for January 23 at 3:35 AM ET:\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Over\" if Newcastle United Jets FC and Wellington Phoenix FC combine to score 4 or more goals in this game.\n\nIf the combined total is less than 4, this market will resolve to \"Under\".\n\nIf the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed. If the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50\u201350.\n\nIf the game is started but not completed, this market will resolve according to the official final score published on a-league.com.au. This market refers only to the outcome within the first 90 minutes of regular play plus stoppage time.",
