    "description": "This market will resolve to \"Yes\" if Vladimir Putin, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, and Donald Trump all meet together between this market's creation and December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nA meeting is defined as any encounter where Putin, Zelenskyy, and Trump are present and interact with each other in person.\n\nThe resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting.",
