    "description": "This market will resolve to \u201cYes\u201d if Tempo (https://tempo.xyz/) officially launches a governance token by 11:59 PM ET on the date specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \u201cNo\u201d.\n\nThe token must be actively and publicly transferable and tradable. Announcements alone do not qualify.\n\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be information from Tempo, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.",
