    "resolution_source": "",
    "description": "This market will resolve to \"Yes\" if Venezuela\u2019s current leader, Acting President Delcy Rodr\u00edguez, is removed from power for any length of time by the specified date, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No\". \n\nRodr\u00edguez will be considered to be removed from power if she resigns, is detained, or otherwise loses his position or is prevented from fulfilling his duties as Acting President of Venezuela within this market's timeframe. \n\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be a consensus of credible reporting.",
