    "description": "This market will resolve to \u201cNo\u201d if any of the following conditions are met between market creation and March 31, 2026, 11:59 ET:\n\n- MicroStrategy sells any Bitcoin\n- MicroStrategy announces holding 750k+ BTC\n- MicroStrategy announces bankruptcy\n- Strategy (MicroStrategy) (MSTR) added to S&P 500\n\nOtherwise, this market will resolve to \u201cYes\u201d.\n\nThe full rules for this market can be found here:\nhttps://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/MicroStrategy.pdf",
