    "description": "This market will resolve to \"Yes\" if the Kharg Island oil terminal is the subject of a kinetic strike between market creation and January 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nMissile/drone strikes which are shot down or don't hit the terminal will not be considered for this market.\n\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be a consensus of credible reporting.\n",
