    "description": "This market will resolve to \"Yes\" if it is widely and credibly confirmed that the operation to capture Nicol\u00e1s Maduro was staged or pre-arranged with Maduro (i.e., facilitated, permitted, or agreed to in advance such that Maduro\u2019s capture was not the result of an adversarial raid) by March 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nStatements from the U.S. government claiming that the operation was staged or pre-arranged will qualify for a \"Yes\" resolution. If no broad consensus has been reached by March 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nThe resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting.",
