    "description": "In the upcoming CBB game, scheduled for January 23 at 2:00 PM ET:\n\nIf the Kennesaw State Owls win, the market will resolve to \"Kennesaw State Owls\".\n\nIf the Louisiana Tech Bulldogs win, the market will resolve to \"Louisiana Tech Bulldogs\".\n\nIf the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed.\n\nIf the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50-50.\n\nThe result will be determined based on the final score including any overtime periods.",
