    "description": "In the upcoming EFL Championship game between Middlesbrough FC and Preston North End FC, scheduled for January 24 at 7:30 AM ET:\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Over\" if Middlesbrough FC and Preston North End FC combine to score 3 or more goals in this game.\n\nIf the combined total is less than 3, this market will resolve to \"Under\".\n\nIf the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed. If the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50\u201350.\n\nIf the game is started but not completed, this market will resolve according to the official final score published on efl.com. This market refers only to the outcome within the first 90 minutes of regular play plus stoppage time.",
