    "description": "The UFC 324: Gaethje vs. Pimblett event is scheduled for January 24, 2026.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Yes\" if Donald Trump attends UFC 324. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nIf the event is canceled or postponed beyond January 26, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \"No\".\n\nAttending the event is defined as being in physical attendance during any part of the event.\n\nThe resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting.",
