    "description": "This market will resolve to \u201cYes\u201d if Valve launches Premier season 4 by January 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \u201cNo\u201d.\n\nOnce launched, this market will remain open for 48 hours. Temporary launches (e.g., for testing) that are reversed within 48 hours will not count.\n\nFor the purpose of this market, \u201cValve\u201d refers to Valve Corporation, the developer and publisher of the Counter-Strike series.\n\nFor the purpose of this market, \u201cPremier season 4\u201d refers to the fourth season of the Premier competitive matchmaking mode in Counter-Strike 2 (CS2), which consists of seasonal leaderboards, rank resets, and associated rewards eligible in Premier mode matchmaking.\n\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from Valve; however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.",
