    "resolution_source": "https://www.uefa.com/",
    "description": "In the upcoming UEFA Champions League game between Liverpool FC and Qaraba\u011f A\u011fdam FK, scheduled for January 28 at 3:00 PM ET:\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Over\" if Liverpool FC and Qaraba\u011f A\u011fdam FK combine to score 5 or more goals in this game.\n\nIf the combined total is less than 5, this market will resolve to \"Under\".\n\nIf the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed. If the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50\u201350.\n\nIf the game is started but not completed, this market will resolve according to the official final score published on uefa.com. This market refers only to the outcome within the first 90 minutes of regular play plus stoppage time.",
