    "resolution_source": "https://ausopen.com/",
    "description": "This market refers to the tennis match between Madison Keys and Karolina Pliskova in the Australian Open WTA, scheduled for January 23 2026.\nThis market will resolve to \"Keys\" if Madison Keys wins by 2 or more sets than Karolina Pliskova, based on the final completed score. Otherwise, it will resolve to \"Pliskova.\"\nIf the match begins but is not completed, this market will resolve 50-50. If the match is canceled before play begins or delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a result, this market will also resolve 50-50.\nResolution will be based on official Grand Slam results.",
