    "tags": [],
    "resolution_source": "",
    "description": "This market will resolve to \"Yes\" if there is a widely reported coup attempt in Venezuela at any point between market creation and March 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No.\"\n\nA coup attempt is defined as a coordinated and deliberate effort by military, security forces, or other state actors (or factions thereof) to overthrow or unlawfully seize control of the Venezuelan government or its leadership. Revolutionary actions by non-state forces, isolated protests, or general unrest will not alone qualify.\n\nClaims by the Venezuelan government that a coup attempt was foiled\u2014such as through arrests or disruption of a planned operation\u2014will only count toward a \"Yes\" resolution if credible independent sources widely report and explicitly characterize the event as a coup attempt. Foiled plots or arrests that occur without any attempted execution of the coup will not qualify.\n\nThe resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting.",
    "best_bid": {
      "yes": 0.069,
      "no": 0.929
    },
    "best_ask": {
      "yes": 0.07100000000000001,
      "no": 0.931
