    "description": "This market refers to whether the cricket match between Chattogram Challengers and Durbar Rajshahi scheduled for 2026-01-23 in BPL T20 Final Stage is completed under the competition's official playing conditions.\nThis market resolves according to the finalized match status as published by https://www.espncricinfo.com/.\nAny match where an official result is declared \u2014 including results decided by DLS/DRS, over-rate penalties, a Super Over, forfeit/walkover, or any other on-field ruling \u2014 will resolve Yes. (Draws count as completed results when recognized by the competition.)\nIf the match is abandoned, ends in No Result, is permanently canceled, or otherwise concludes without an official result, the market will resolve No.\nIf the match is postponed or rescheduled, the market remains open until the listed fixture is completed or permanently canceled, after which it will resolve as described above.\n",
    "best_bid": {
      "yes": 0.534,
      "no": 0.464
    },
    "best_ask": {
      "yes": 0.536,
      "no": 0.466
    },
