    "description": "This market will resolve to \"Yes\" if, at any point between this market\u2019s creation and market close on the final day of trading prior to or on the listed date, any 1-minute candle for the Dow Jones Industrial Average (^DJI) shows a final \"High\" price equal to or above 50,000. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \"No.\"\n\nAll prices recorded during regular trading hours of the primary exchange for the instrument, as reflected in Yahoo Finance's 1-minute interval (\"1m\") data, will be considered.\n\nPeriods when the market is officially closed (e.g., holidays or maintenance breaks) will not be considered.\n\nAll times referenced are local to the primary exchange on which the index trades.\n\nThe resolution source for this market is Yahoo Finance \u2014 specifically, the 1-minute interval (\"1m\") chart data for the Dow Jones Industrial Average (^DJI) available at https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI/.",
