    "description": "In the upcoming Premier League game, scheduled for January 25 at 11:30 AM ET:\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Arsenal FC\" if Arsenal FC win the game by 2 or more goals.\n\nOtherwise, this market will resolve to \"Manchester United FC\".\n\nIf the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed. If the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50\u201350.\n\nThis market will resolve according to the official final score published on premierleague.com. This market refers only to the outcome within the first 90 minutes of regular play plus stoppage time.",
